menu "TriNetra Node Configuration"

    config TN_FIRMWARE_VERSION
        string "Firmware version string"
        default "1.0.0"

    config TN_DEFAULT_SSID
        string "Default WiFi SSID"
        default ""
        help
            Fallback SSID, used only when NVS holds no provisioned config.
            Leave EMPTY here and provision over serial instead.

            Anything set here is compiled into every binary built from this
            tree and is readable straight back out with `strings`. For a
            throwaway bench setup you may set it locally — sdkconfig is
            gitignored — but never commit it.

    config TN_DEFAULT_PASSWORD
        string "Default WiFi password"
        default ""
        help
            Leave EMPTY. Use provision.py, which writes credentials to NVS
            over the serial console so they never enter the source tree or
            the firmware image.

    config TN_DEFAULT_TARGET_IP
        string "Default sensing server IP"
        default "192.168.1.20"
        help
            Where the node sends CSI. This MUST be the machine running
            `npm run live`, on the same subnet the node joins.

            A wrong value here fails silently in the most confusing way
            possible: the node associates, the LED behaves, the console
            reports "online", and it streams UDP to an address that does not
            exist. UDP is unacknowledged, so nothing anywhere reports an
            error — the server simply shows no nodes.

            Note this is a DHCP address and can change when the server
            reboots. Give that machine a static lease on the router if the
            nodes start going quiet for no reason.

    config TN_DEFAULT_TARGET_PORT
        int "Default sensing server UDP port"
        default 5005
        range 1 65535

    config TN_DEFAULT_NODE_ID
        int "Default node ID"
        default 1
        range 1 254
        help
            Unique per node within a deployment. The server keys all
            per-node state on this value.

endmenu
